title: "rvfitter"
abstract: "Radial velocities of ultracool dwarfs from reduced 1D spectra, with several independent techniques (line centring, cross-correlation, template fitting, forward-model MCMC, least-squares deconvolution, telluric referencing) combined hierarchically into one adopted value with a full error budget."
